        "text": "Yes, what about 2 nights instead of 4?"
      },
      "dialogue_id": "SNG1006.json",
      "history": [
        {
          "role": "user",
          "source_turn_id": "SNG1006.json#turn0",
          "text": "I'm looking for a hotel to stay at in the centre, can you look this up for me?"
        },
        {
          "role": "system",
          "source_turn_id": "SNG1006.json#turn1",
          "text": "There are three hotels in the center of town. Do you prefer something moderate or expensive? "
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "source_turn_id": "SNG1006.json#turn2",
          "text": "Not in terms of that, but do they have free parking and have a 3 star rating?"
        },
        {
          "role": "system",
          "source_turn_id": "SNG1006.json#turn3",
          "text": "The Gonville hotel has 3 stars and parking, and the University Arms hotel has 4 stars and parking. They are both expensive. Would you like more details? "
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "source_turn_id": "SNG1006.json#turn4",
          "text": "Okay, I'd like to book a room at the Gonville Hotel for 4 nights. There will be 6 people and we will be arriving on Saturday. "
        },
        {
          "role": "system",
          "source_turn_id": "SNG1006.json#turn5",
          "text": "I'm sorry, there are no rooms available for that length of stay.  Could you shorten your stay or book a different day possibly?"
        }
      ],
